    "title": "Rag Shag parade returns for Halloween season - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Trent Levakis ,\n12 hours ago EASTHAMPTON — The annual Rag Shag Parade returned to Easthampton on Oct. 28, filling the streets with monsters, ghouls, goblins and plenty of other characters. Hundreds of costumed children and their families marched from the former Maple Street School, down Cottage Street, and then eventually to Easthampton High School, where they received some early Halloween candy. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
